Complex conjugation in the bra is essential to the orthogonality check: $\begin{aligned}
\braket{i}{o}
&=\frac12(\bra{u}-i\bra{d})(\ket{u}-i\ket{d})\\
&=\frac12\bigl(1+(-i)(-i)\bigr)=0.\end{aligned}$

